expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Generates an application (also available as `leptoskit new`)

Usage: leptoskit generate app [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Destination directory

Options:
      --platform <PLATFORM>            The default build platform. Standard projects include all six; HarmonyOS generates its experimental standalone starter [default: web]
      --native-target <NATIVE_TARGET>  Select a native default, or the standalone HarmonyOS starter (requires --platform native)
      --name <NAME>                    Package name, otherwise taken from the directory
      --sdk-path <SDK_PATH>            A local leptoskit repository whose crates the project depends on by path instead of the published release
  -h, --help                           Print help
  -V, --version                        Print version
